d number 286221.<br>Today's date is 14 September 2026. Your IP: 172.70.135.48 <br>© 2025 Farside Investors. All rights reserved. |\n\n──────── [TRUNCATED] ────────\nShowing 13,432 chars (head) + 4,450 chars (tail) of 71,939 total clean characters.\nFull text saved to: /Users/kaide/.hermes/cache/web/farside.co.uk-9e3bcf50f8.md\nTo read the omitted middle: read_file path=\"/Users/kaide/.hermes/cache/web/farside.co.uk-9e3bcf50f8.md\" offset=140 limit=200  (the file is the complete page; raise/lower offset to page through it).\n─────────────────────────────",
